nodes.body:
@mickqian Following up on my September 28 request: could you review this VAE-only slice of #18891 and advise on the appropriate server/CUDA validation?

The PR records 14 passing CPU regressions and real FLUX.2 VAE component checks, including reproduction of stale persistent buffers on the baseline. Full diffusion-server/CUDA validation is still pending. The overlap with #33588 is documented; text-encoder work remains outside this PR.

The PR is ready for review; the displayed Base CI failure came from the earlier draft gate. The branch also needs updating for #21065's minimum base, and `run-ci` is missing. Could you help review the approach and enable the relevant CI after that update? Thanks!

